      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    open_prices = [150, 152, 153, 151, 152, 150, 149, 151, 150, 148, 147, 146, 148, 149, 147]\n    close_prices = [152, 150, 152, 153, 151, 152, 150, 149, 151, 150, 149, 148, 146, 147, 148]\n    period = 14\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    gains = []\n    losses = []\n\n    for opening, closing in zip(open_prices, close_prices):\n        if closing > opening:\n            gains.append(closing - opening)\n            losses.append(0)\n        else:\n            gains.append(0)\n            losses.append(opening - closing)\n\n    sum_gains = sum(gains[-period:])\n    sum_losses = sum(losses[-period:])\n    imi = (sum_gains / (sum_gains + sum_losses)) * 100\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(imi, 2)\n```",
